<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Quantum cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Quantum cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal Investment Research analyst David Takata on Tuesday reduced his rating on Quantum Corp to outperform long term from outperform because of concerns about the market.</p>
<p>-- He did not change his estimates.</p>
<p>-- The reduction was made &quot;because of concerns about the strength of the PC market relative to expectations. As seen in the networking group, weakness in a given sector, real or suspected, brings down stocks of all vendors, weak or strong.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Quantum's shares were off 5/16 to 38 in mid-morning trade.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
